    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "In an effort to study perspective taking in VR (VRPT) as part of the Virtual Human Interaction Lab, a post treatment questionnaire was conducted which examined Selfishness, Distrust and Coordination in negotiation in the from of games. In the scope of this, we created the Circle Tracking Game, a new game designed to test coordination.",
